{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01MMEm3DCwK41Rpyg8g4xcWG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed predicted experimental results for the \"worst\" tier scenario for each planned experiment in their experiment plan. Let me carefully go through each planned experiment and generate realistic worst-case predictions based on the worst tier definition.\n\nLet me understand the worst tier:\n- Core per-DOF hypothesis does not transfer to real VLA\n- A3 kill criterion triggered (CRM without conformal features performs similarly to full ACR-VLA)\n- Method reduces to generic residual policy\n\nKey metric ranges for worst tier:\n- acr_vla_libero_plus_success_gain_abs: [0, 5]\n\n\n- a3_ablation_gap_no_conformal_vs_full: [0, 2]\n- a4_ablation_gap_scalar_vs_perDOF: [-1, 1]\n- coc_success_spearman_rho: [0.05, 0.3]\n- aci_ellipsoid_volume_narrowing_pct: [0, 10]\n- srpo_stacking_gain_abs: [0, 2]\n- srpo_stacked_absolute: [82, 84]\n- libero_nominal_drop: [2, 5]\n\nNow I'm looking at the expected metric ranges for the worst-case scenario across all the planned experiments.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11285,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11285},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7d120e96-99ee-4673-a8af-ddbc24807528","uuid":"d4d3aeb5-cc80-4f6f-aab9-5ed39e6f63d5"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01MMEm3DCwK41Rpyg8g4xcWG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 不可维持。需要重构 story 从 method paper 转为 analysis/empirical-study paper。\n  核心转向: \"When does multivariate conformal prediction help robot action correction? A systematic empirical study.\"\n  贡献变为: (1) 负面结果的价值——证明 synthetic MVP 中的 per-DOF advantage 不能 naively transfer\n  到 high-dimensional VLA action spaces，分析为什么 (covariance degeneracy, K=10 insufficient,\n  flow-matching sample geometry); (2) 对比分析 CGS vs scalar CP vs DiU 在不同分布偏移类型下的行为差异，\n  提供 practitioner guidance; (3) COC 信号失败模式的系统分析——什么条件下自参考校准信号可靠/不可靠。\n  放弃 CoRL 投稿，瞄 ICLR 2027 workshop 或 reframe 后投 ICLR 2027 main。若 CRM 本身（不依赖\n  conformal features）仍有 >5% 增益，可考虑退到 \"observation-conditioned residual correction\" 的\n  simpler story，但这与 A2C2 区分度低。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"ACR-VLA Full Pipeline on SmolVLA\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: >\n      ACR-VLA full pipeline on SmolVLA base: CGS + ACI/COC + CRM. Train CRM on LIBERO demos\n      + synthetic augmentation. Evaluate on LIBERO (nominal preservation) + LIBERO-Plus L3-L5.\n    expected_results:\n      libero_nominal_success_rate_base: 0.95\n      libero_nominal_success_rate_acr: 0.91\n      libero_nominal_drop_pct: 4.2\n      libero_plus_L3_success_base: 0.42\n      libero_plus_L3_success_acr: 0.45\n      libero_plus_L4_success_base: 0.28\n      libero_plus_L4_success_acr: 0.31\n      libero_plus_L5_success_base: 0.15\n      libero_plus_L5_success_acr: 0.18\n      libero_plus_avg_success_gain_abs: 3.3\n      crm_train_loss_final: 0.0082\n      cgs_avg_coverage_empirical: 0.87\n      cgs_ledoit_wolf_shrinkage_intensity: 0.91\n      inference_latency_overhead_ms: 14.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 worst 档下，ACR-VLA 全流程仅带来 ~3% 的 LIBERO-Plus 绝对增益。根本原因在于 flow-matching\n      VLA 的 K=10 样本在 7D action space 中的协方差结构严重退化：Ledoit-Wolf shrinkage intensity\n      达 0.91（接近 1.0 = 对角阵），意味着估计的协方差几乎完全被 shrink 到对角形式，CGS 提取的\n      per-DOF conformal 特征实质上退化为独立的 per-dimension marginal 信息，丧失了 multivariate CP\n      的核心优势——跨维度协方差编码。CRM 仍然学到了一些有用的观测条件残差（来自 observation embedding），\n      但 conformal 特征的贡献微乎其微。名义性能下降 4.2% 超过理想范围，因为 CRM 在 in-distribution\n      数据上的残差校正引入了不必要的扰动——分布内样本本身质量较高，校正反而降低了精度。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 1: LIBERO / LIBERO-Plus Success Rates\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"LIBERO (nominal)\", \"L3\", \"L4\", \"L5\", \"Plus-Avg\", \"Δ vs Base\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"SmolVLA (base)\", \"95.0%\", \"42.0%\", \"28.0%\", \"15.0%\", \"28.3%\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"ACR-VLA (ours)\", \"91.0%\", \"45.0%\", \"31.0%\", \"18.0%\", \"31.3%\", \"+3.0\"]\n          - [\"SRPO (reported)\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", \"82.1%\", \"—\"]\n      - name: \"Table 2: CGS Covariance Diagnostics\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"MVP (3D)\", \"VLA (7D)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Ledoit-Wolf shrinkage intensity\", \"0.42\", \"0.91\"]\n          - [\"Effective rank of Σ̂\", \"2.7\", \"1.3\"]\n          - [\"Off-diagonal magnitude (mean |r_ij|)\", \"0.38\", \"0.06\"]\n          - [\"Condition number (shrunk Σ̂)\", \"4.2\", \"1.8\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Covariance heatmap comparison — MVP 3D (clear off-diagonal structure) vs VLA 7D (near-diagonal after shrinkage). 直观展示 K=10 + high-dim 导致协方差信息丧失。\"\n      - \"Fig: Per-task success rate scatter — base vs ACR-VLA on LIBERO-Plus 10 tasks. 多数任务增益 <5%, 个别任务出现负增益。\"\n    analysis: >\n      全流程结果确认了 worst 档核心假设：K=10 样本在 7D 空间下的 Ledoit-Wolf 估计产生近对角协方差，\n      CGS 的 multivariate CP 优势不存在。3.3% 的增益主要来自 CRM 的 observation-conditioned 残差\n      能力，而非 conformal 特征。名义性能 4.2% 下降是一个严重信号，表明 CRM 在 in-distribution 上\n      过度校正。这为后续 A3 ablation 设定了基线——如果 A3 gap 很小，则确认 conformal 特征无贡献。\n\n  - name: \"A3 Ablation — CRM without Conformal Features\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: >\n      CRM without conformal features (observation-conditioned residual only, equivalent to\n      A2C2-style generic residual). MAKE-OR-BREAK for Claim 1.\n    expected_results:\n      libero_plus_avg_success_acr_full: 0.313\n      libero_plus_avg_success_a3_no_conformal: 0.305\n      a3_ablation_gap_abs: 0.8\n      a3_ablation_gap_pct_relative: 2.6\n      libero_nominal_a3: 0.92\n      a3_vs_full_pvalue_paired_ttest: 0.38\n    result_rationale: >\n      A3 kill criterion 触发。去掉 45D conformal 特征后，CRM 仅依赖 observation embedding 做残差\n      校正，性能仅下降 0.8 个百分点（统计不显著，p=0.38）。这直接证明在真实 VLA 设置下，conformal\n      特征几乎不携带 CRM 无法从 observation 中获取的额外信息。原因有二：(1) 如 plan_001 分析，\n      K=10 + Ledoit-Wolf 产生的协方差过度 shrink，per-DOF 特征退化为近似 isotropic 的无差别信号；\n      (2) CRM 的 observation encoder 已经隐式捕获了\"当前观测与训练分布的偏差\"信息，这与 CGS 试图\n      编码的 epistemic uncertainty 高度冗余。在 MVP 3D 环境下 per-DOF 特征有效是因为：3D 空间\n      K=10 给出 p/n=0.3 的合理比率，协方差结构保留完好；而 7D 空间 p/n=0.7 时结构信息被 shrinkage\n      抹杀。这是一个 dimensionality-driven 的 transfer failure。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 3: A3 Ablation — Conformal Features Kill Test\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"LIBERO (nom.)\", \"Plus-Avg\", \"Δ vs Full\", \"p-value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"ACR-VLA (full, 45D conf.)\", \"91.0%\", \"31.3%\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"A3: no conformal (obs only)\", \"92.0%\", \"30.5%\", \"-0.8\", \"0.38\"]\n          - [\"SmolVLA (base, no CRM)\", \"95.0%\", \"28.3%\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n      - name: \"Table 4: A3 Detailed Per-Level Breakdown\"\n        columns: [\"Level\", \"Full ACR-VLA\", \"A3 (no conf.)\", \"Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"L3\", \"45.0%\", \"44.5%\", \"-0.5\"]\n          - [\"L4\", \"31.0%\", \"30.0%\", \"-1.0\"]\n          - [\"L5\", \"18.0%\", \"17.0%\", \"-1.0\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Bar chart with error bars — Full ACR-VLA vs A3 vs Base on LIBERO-Plus. Error bars (95% CI) 大幅重叠，gap 不显著。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Kill criterion 触发：A3 gap = 0.8% < 2% 阈值，且统计不显著。Claim 1 (\"per-DOF conformal features\n      enable dimension-selective correction\") 在真实 VLA 上不成立。CRM 的全部增益来自 observation-conditioned\n      残差，与 A2C2 类方法功能等价。这是论文核心贡献的致命打击——方法的独特卖点（将 multivariate CP 统计量\n      作为校正网络输入特征）被证伪。值得保留的发现是 CRM 残差本身仍有 ~2-3% 的增益（A3 vs base），但这\n      不构成新颖贡献。\n\n  - name: \"A4 Ablation — Scalar vs Per-DOF Uncertainty Features\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: >\n      CRM with scalar uncertainty (Euclidean distance like ReconVLA) replacing 45D per-DOF\n      features. Validates per-DOF > scalar.\n    expected_results:\n      libero_plus_avg_success_a4_scalar: 0.310\n      libero_plus_avg_success_full_perDOF: 0.313\n      a4_ablation_gap_abs: 0.3\n      a4_pvalue: 0.62\n      libero_nominal_a4: 0.915\n    result_rationale: >\n      Per-DOF vs scalar gap 仅 0.3 个百分点，完全在噪声范围内（p=0.62），落入 worst 档的 [-1, 1] 区间。\n      这与 A3 结果高度一致：如果 conformal 特征整体贡献几乎为零（A3 gap ~0.8%），那么 conformal\n      特征的 granularity（per-DOF vs scalar）自然也不会有区别。两种特征形式都只是噪声输入，CRM 学会\n      忽略它们而依赖 observation embedding。这进一步确认了 worst 档假设——在 K=10 flow-matching\n      样本的退化协方差下，无论用 45D 还是 1D 编码 uncertainty，信息量都接近零。MVP 中 per-DOF 的\n      显著优势（group6: 0.024512 vs 0.029498, ~17% 相对改善）完全无法复现，因为 MVP 的 3D 空间\n      协方差结构是真实可估计的，而 7D VLA 空间中协方差信息被 shrinkage 摧毁。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: A4 Ablation — Per-DOF vs Scalar\"\n        columns: [\"Feature Type\", \"Dim\", \"Plus-Avg\", \"Δ vs Full\", \"p-value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Per-DOF (full ACR-VLA)\", \"45D\", \"31.3%\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Scalar (Euclidean)\", \"1D\", \"31.0%\", \"-0.3\", \"0.62\"]\n          - [\"No conformal (A3)\", \"0D\", \"30.5%\", \"-0.8\", \"0.38\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 三种 feature granularity (45D, 1D, 0D) 的 LIBERO-Plus 成功率。三者几乎持平，error bars 完全重叠。对比 MVP 结果中 per-DOF 的显著优势，展示 transfer gap。\"\n    analysis: >\n      A4 结果与 A3 形成完整的否定证据链：不仅 conformal 特征整体贡献微弱（A3），per-DOF 的额外\n      granularity 也不提供任何增量（A4）。这否定了 Claim 1 的全部两层逻辑。对 empirical study\n      reframe 而言，这是一个有价值的负面结果——可以精确量化 MVP-to-VLA transfer gap 并分析 root cause。\n\n  - name: \"SRPO Stacking\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: >\n      ACR-VLA stacked on SRPO-finetuned VLA. Train new CRM on SRPO checkpoint + LIBERO demos.\n      Evaluate on LIBERO-Plus.\n    expected_results:\n      srpo_baseline_libero_plus: 0.821\n      srpo_plus_acr_libero_plus: 0.832\n      srpo_stacking_gain_abs: 1.1\n      srpo_stacking_pvalue: 0.29\n      srpo_nominal_drop: 1.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      SRPO stacking gain 仅 1.1%（82.1% → 83.2%），落入 worst 档 [0, 2] 区间且统计不显著。\n      根本原因：SRPO 通过 RL finetuning 已经在训练时对 LIBERO-Plus 的分布偏移做了适应，留给\n      inference-time correction 的残差空间极小。SRPO 已将 base VLA 从 ~28% 提升到 82.1%，\n      吃掉了绝大部分可恢复的性能差距。CRM 能校正的残余错误主要是 SRPO 也无法解决的 fundamental\n      failures（如完全未见过的 layout 组合），这些 failure modes 不是简单的 action bias 可以\n      通过残差校正解决的。此外，SRPO 的 policy 已经过 RL 优化，action distribution 更加 peaked，\n      K=10 flow-matching 样本的多样性更低，进一步削弱了 CGS 的统计估计质量。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 6: SRPO Stacking Results\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Plus-Avg\", \"Δ vs SRPO\", \"p-value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"SRPO (baseline)\", \"82.1%\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"SRPO + ACR-VLA\", \"83.2%\", \"+1.1\", \"0.29\"]\n          - [\"SmolVLA + ACR-VLA\", \"31.3%\", \"+3.0 vs base\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Stacking gain diminishing returns — X轴: base policy 性能，Y轴: ACR-VLA 增量。展示 base 越强增量越小的趋势。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Claim 3 降级为 \"complementary in principle\"。1.1% 增益不构成 convincing evidence of orthogonal\n      value。对 reframed paper，这支持一个 insight：inference-time correction 的 ceiling 受限于\n      training-time optimization 已覆盖的 error modes。当 base policy 很强时，剩余 failures 是\n      结构性的，不可通过 action residual 修复。\n\n  - name: \"COC Signal Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: >\n      COC signal validation: (a) Spearman ρ between episode COC coverage fraction and task\n      success, (b) ACI convergence plot, (c) ellipsoid volume comparison vs static calibration.\n    expected_results:\n      coc_success_spearman_rho: 0.18\n      coc_success_spearman_pvalue: 0.04\n      aci_converged_episodes_pct: 0.72\n      aci_convergence_steps_median: 85\n      aci_final_coverage_mean: 0.89\n      aci_target_coverage: 0.90\n      ellipsoid_volume_aci_vs_static_narrowing_pct: 6.5\n      ellipsoid_volume_aci_mean_log: 2.31\n      ellipsoid_volume_static_mean_log: 2.47\n    result_rationale: >\n      COC-success Spearman ρ = 0.18，虽统计显著（p=0.04，因为 N 足够大）但实质相关性极弱，远低于\n      可用阈值。核心问题：COC 是一个 chunk-overlap 一致性度量，衡量相邻 action chunks 的预测\n      一致性。在高分布偏移下（L4-L5），VLA 的预测本身已经高度不稳定，COC 信号的 noise floor 很高。\n      更根本的是，COC 衡量的是\"预测一致性\"而非\"预测正确性\"——一个 consistently wrong 的 policy\n      会产生高 COC 但低 success。ACI 虽然 converge 到接近目标覆盖率（0.89 vs 0.90 target），\n      但 ellipsoid volume 仅收窄 6.5%（低于 10% 阈值），说明 ACI 的在线适应相比 static calibration\n      几乎没有 tighten confidence region 的效果。原因是 COC 信号太嘈杂，ACI 的 step-size 需要\n      设得很小才能 converge，导致适应速度极慢，ellipsoid 几乎不变。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 7: COC Signal Quality\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Value\", \"Threshold\", \"Pass?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Spearman ρ (COC vs success)\", \"0.18\", \">0.3\", \"FAIL\"]\n          - [\"p-value\", \"0.04\", \"<0.05\", \"PASS (but weak ρ)\"]\n          - [\"Ellipsoid narrowing vs static\", \"6.5%\", \">10%\", \"FAIL\"]\n          - [\"ACI coverage (target=0.90)\", \"0.89\", \"±0.02\", \"PASS\"]\n      - name: \"Table 8: ACI Convergence by Perturbation Level\"\n        columns: [\"Level\", \"Converged %\", \"Median Steps\", \"Final Coverage\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"L3\", \"82%\", \"62\", \"0.90\"]\n          - [\"L4\", \"70%\", \"91\", \"0.88\"]\n          - [\"L5\", \"58%\", \"118\", \"0.87\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Scatter plot — COC episode fraction (X) vs task success (Y, binary). 点云分散，弱正相关趋势几乎不可辨。\"\n      - \"Fig: ACI alpha trajectory across episodes，分 L3/L4/L5。L3 平稳收敛，L5 oscillate 严重。\"\n      - \"Fig: Ellipsoid volume CDF — ACI vs static。两条曲线几乎重合，narrowing 微弱。\"\n    analysis: >\n      COC 作为自参考校准信号在真实 VLA 上不可靠。Claim 2 的 kill criterion 部分触发（ρ < 0.3 AND\n      narrowing < 10% 均满足）。ACI 虽然能 converge coverage，但这只是因为 conformal prediction\n      的理论保证——它并不意味着 ACI 提供了比 static 更有用的 uncertainty 估计。对 reframed paper，\n      COC 失败模式分析本身是有价值的贡献：可以系统地刻画什么条件下 self-referential calibration 信号\n      可靠（低偏移、policy 足够 smooth）vs 不可靠（高偏移、prediction instability）。\n\n  - name: \"A1 Ablation — CRM without ACI\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: >\n      CRM without ACI (static CGS calibration, no online adaptation). Isolates ACI contribution.\n    expected_results:\n      libero_plus_avg_a1_static: 0.308\n      libero_plus_avg_full_aci: 0.313\n      a1_gap_abs: 0.5\n      a1_pvalue: 0.51\n      libero_nominal_a1: 0.915\n    result_rationale: >\n      ACI 贡献仅 0.5 个百分点，不显著。与 plan_005 的 COC 信号分析一致：如果 COC 信号本身就不\n      可靠（ρ=0.18），那么基于 COC 的 ACI 在线更新自然不能比 static calibration 做得更好。\n      ACI 的 alpha 调整幅度太小（因为 step size 保守以应对 noisy COC），实质上 conformal threshold\n      几乎没有偏离初始 static 值。此外，由于 A3 已表明 conformal 特征整体贡献微弱，ACI 对 conformal\n      threshold 的精细调整更是无关紧要——即便 threshold 是完美的，产生的 per-DOF 特征也不被 CRM 有效利用。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 9: A1 Ablation — ACI Contribution\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Plus-Avg\", \"Δ vs Full\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Full ACR-VLA (ACI)\", \"31.3%\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"A1: Static CGS (no ACI)\", \"30.8%\", \"-0.5\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: ACI vs Static alpha 轨迹对比。Static 保持恒定，ACI 仅微小波动，两者产生的 conformal region 几乎相同。\"\n    analysis: >\n      ACI 组件在 worst 档下无实质贡献。结合 A3 的 conformal features 无贡献结论，ACI 优化的是\n      一个本身就无用的信号通道。\n\n  - name: \"A2 Ablation — ACI without CRM\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: >\n      ACI without CRM (CGS + COC + sample selection only, extending ReconVLA to multivariate).\n      Isolates CRM contribution.\n    expected_results:\n      libero_plus_avg_a2_no_crm: 0.295\n      libero_plus_avg_full: 0.313\n      a2_vs_base_gain: 1.2\n      a2_vs_full_gap: 1.8\n      libero_nominal_a2: 0.94\n    result_rationale: >\n      无 CRM 时，ACR-VLA 退化为基于 multivariate CP 的 sample selection 方法（类似 ReconVLA 但用\n      Mahalanobis distance 替代 Euclidean distance）。增益仅 1.2%（vs base 28.3% → 29.5%）。\n      原因：(1) 样本选择只能从 K=10 个已有样本中选最好的，不能合成新动作——ceiling 很低；\n      (2) 在 K=10 退化协方差下，Mahalanobis distance 和 Euclidean distance 高度相关（因为协方差\n      近对角），multivariate extension 不比 ReconVLA 的标量方案好多少。CRM 的存在至少提供了\n      observation-conditioned 残差校正能力（A2 vs full gap = 1.8%），这是该 pipeline 中唯一\n      有实质贡献的组件，但这个贡献不依赖 conformal features（如 A3 所示）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 10: A2 Ablation — CRM Contribution\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Plus-Avg\", \"Nominal\", \"Δ vs Base\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base SmolVLA\", \"28.3%\", \"95.0%\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"A2: CGS+ACI only (no CRM)\", \"29.5%\", \"94.0%\", \"+1.2\"]\n          - [\"Full ACR-VLA\", \"31.3%\", \"91.0%\", \"+3.0\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 组件分解 bar chart — Base → +CGS/ACI selection → +CRM。Selection 贡献 ~1.2%, CRM 贡献 ~1.8%。\"\n    analysis: >\n      A2 确认 CRM（残差校正）是 pipeline 中唯一有意义的组件。但 A3 已证明 CRM 的效果不依赖\n      conformal features。组合 A2+A3 的结论：ACR-VLA = observation-conditioned residual + marginal\n      sample selection benefit，与原始 framing 的 \"structured uncertainty-driven correction\" 无关。\n\n  - name: \"Per-Perturbation Breakdown\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      ACR-VLA gain across 7 LIBERO-Plus perturbation dimensions (camera, noise, robot-state,\n      light, background, layout, language).\n    expected_results:\n      gain_camera: 5.2\n      gain_noise: 4.8\n      gain_robot_state: 3.1\n      gain_light: 2.5\n      gain_background: 1.8\n      gain_layout: -0.5\n      gain_language: -1.2\n      perturbation_dims_with_significant_gain: 2\n      perturbation_dims_with_negative: 2\n    result_rationale: >\n      仅 2 个维度（camera, noise）显示显著增益（>3%），与 worst 档 [0, 2] 维度范围吻合。\n      Camera 和 noise 是 synthetic augmentation 能较好覆盖的偏移类型——随机 crop/resize 和\n      Gaussian noise 是标准数据增强，CRM 在这两类偏移上有充足的训练数据。但即使在这两个维度上，\n      增益也主要来自 observation-conditioned residual（与 A3 一致），而非 conformal features。\n      Layout 和 language 出现负增益，因为这两类偏移无法通过 synthetic augmentation 覆盖，\n      CRM 面临 out-of-distribution 输入且过度校正。Layout 改变了物体空间关系，CRM 学到的\n      残差模式不适用；language 改变了任务语义，CRM 的 observation encoder 无法正确解读意图。\n      这两个维度的 negative transfer 是 worst 档的典型特征——CRM 在未见过的偏移类型上有害。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 11: Per-Perturbation Success Rate Breakdown\"\n        columns: [\"Perturbation\", \"Base\", \"ACR-VLA\", \"Δ\", \"Significant?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Camera\", \"38.0%\", \"43.2%\", \"+5.2\", \"Yes (p<0.05)\"]\n          - [\"Noise\", \"35.0%\", \"39.8%\", \"+4.8\", \"Yes (p<0.05)\"]\n          - [\"Robot-state\", \"30.0%\", \"33.1%\", \"+3.1\", \"Marginal (p=0.08)\"]\n          - [\"Light\", \"42.0%\", \"44.5%\", \"+2.5\", \"No (p=0.15)\"]\n          - [\"Background\", \"40.0%\", \"41.8%\", \"+1.8\", \"No (p=0.22)\"]\n          - [\"Layout\", \"22.0%\", \"21.5%\", \"-0.5\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"Language\", \"18.0%\", \"16.8%\", \"-1.2\", \"No\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Radar/spider chart — 7 perturbation dimensions 的 ACR-VLA gain。右侧 camera/noise 突出，左侧 layout/language 凹陷。\"\n      - \"Fig: Heatmap — perturbation type × action DOF 的 CRM correction magnitude。展示 CRM 在不同偏移下的校正行为模式。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Per-perturbation 分析揭示了 synthetic augmentation 的根本局限：只有 augmentation 能覆盖的\n      偏移类型（camera, noise）才有增益，无法覆盖的类型（layout, language）反而有害。这对 reframed\n      paper 是一个有价值的 finding：practitioner guidance 应强调 inference-time correction 方法\n      需要与 training-time augmentation 的 coverage 匹配。\n\n  - name: \"A5 Ablation — CGS vs Bonferroni\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: >\n      CGS (joint Mahalanobis) vs per-DOF Bonferroni correction. Validates multivariate CP advantage.\n    expected_results:\n      libero_plus_avg_cgs_joint: 0.313\n      libero_plus_avg_bonferroni: 0.311\n      a5_gap_abs: 0.2\n      a5_pvalue: 0.74\n    result_rationale: >\n      CGS vs Bonferroni gap 仅 0.2%，完全在噪声范围内。由于 K=10 Ledoit-Wolf shrinkage 将协方差\n      矩阵推向近对角形式，joint Mahalanobis ellipsoid 和 per-DOF Bonferroni rectangle 在形状上\n      高度相似（均近似 axis-aligned）。multivariate CP 相对于 marginal Bonferroni 的理论优势\n      （更紧的 joint region、跨维度协方差利用）在协方差退化时不存在。这从另一个角度确认了 worst\n      档核心问题：K=10 在 7D 空间中不足以支撑有意义的 multivariate 统计。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 12: A5 — CGS vs Bonferroni\"\n        columns: [\"CP Method\", \"Plus-Avg\", \"Ellipsoid Vol (log)\", \"Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"CGS (joint Mahal.)\", \"31.3%\", \"2.31\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Bonferroni (per-DOF)\", \"31.1%\", \"2.45\", \"-0.2\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 2D slice (DOF 1 vs DOF 2) of CGS ellipse vs Bonferroni rectangle。两者几乎重合（ellipse nearly circular, rectangle nearly square）。\"\n    analysis: >\n      进一步确认 multivariate CP 在 K=10 + high-dim 下无优势。对 reframed paper 的贡献：\n      提供了 p/n ratio threshold 的 empirical evidence——multivariate CP 何时 degrade 到\n      与 marginal 等价。\n\n  - name: \"A6 Ablation — COC vs Episode-Level Success for ACI\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      COC signal vs episode-level task success for ACI update. Validates self-referential\n      per-step signal.\n    expected_results:\n      libero_plus_avg_a6_episode_signal: 0.318\n      libero_plus_avg_coc_signal: 0.313\n      a6_gap_abs: -0.5\n      ellipsoid_narrowing_episode_pct: 12.8\n      ellipsoid_narrowing_coc_pct: 6.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      Episode-level success signal 实际上比 COC 自参考信号表现更好（+0.5%），且 ellipsoid\n      narrowing 更大（12.8% vs 6.5%）。这直接否定了 Claim 2 的核心 value proposition——\n      自参考 COC 信号应该比需要外部监督的 episode signal 更有价值，但事实相反。原因是 episode\n      success 是 ground truth supervision，虽然粒度更粗（per-episode vs per-step）且需要\n      等到 episode 结束，但信号质量远高于 COC 的嘈杂 proxy。COC 作为 per-step 信号的优势\n      （更快适应、不需要外部 reward）在实践中被其 noise 抵消。这对 reframed paper 是一个重要\n      negative result：self-referential calibration 在信号质量上无法替代 external supervision。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 13: A6 — ACI Signal Source Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Signal\", \"Plus-Avg\", \"Ellipsoid Narrowing\", \"Requires External?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"COC (self-referential)\", \"31.3%\", \"6.5%\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"Episode success\", \"31.8%\", \"12.8%\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"Static (no adaptation)\", \"30.8%\", \"0%\", \"No\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: ACI alpha 轨迹对比——COC signal (高 variance oscillation) vs episode signal (smooth convergence)。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Self-referential COC 信号劣于 episode-level external signal，否定 Claim 2 的 practical value。\n      对 empirical study reframe 有价值：量化了 self-referential vs supervised calibration 的 gap，\n      提供 guidance on when self-referential is acceptable（低偏移、高 SNR 场景）vs not（高偏移）。\n\n  - name: \"A7 Ablation — DiU Aleatoric vs CGS Epistemic Features\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      CRM with DiU aleatoric features replacing CGS epistemic features. Also test combined\n      epistemic+aleatoric 52D input.\n    expected_results:\n      libero_plus_avg_cgs_epistemic: 0.313\n      libero_plus_avg_diu_aleatoric: 0.316\n      libero_plus_avg_combined_52d: 0.314\n      a7_diu_vs_cgs_gap: 0.3\n      a7_combined_vs_cgs_gap: 0.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      DiU aleatoric features 略优于 CGS epistemic features（+0.3%），但差异不显著，三种配置几乎\n      持平。结合 A3 结论（conformal features 整体贡献 ~0.8%），epistemic vs aleatoric 的区分\n      在 0.8% 的总预算内进行比较本身就意义有限。DiU 略优的可能原因：DiU 的 single-pass aleatoric\n      uncertainty 不依赖 K=10 多次采样的协方差估计，避免了 K=10 退化问题，提供了稍微更稳定的\n      per-DOF uncertainty signal。但这个优势极其微弱，不足以支撑任何 claim。Combined 52D 没有\n      额外增益，说明两类特征高度冗余或都不被 CRM 有效利用。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 14: A7 — Epistemic vs Aleatoric Features\"\n        columns: [\"Feature Source\", \"Dim\", \"Plus-Avg\", \"Δ vs CGS\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"CGS epistemic\", \"45D\", \"31.3%\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"DiU aleatoric\", \"7D\", \"31.6%\", \"+0.3\"]\n          - [\"Combined\", \"52D\", \"31.4%\", \"+0.1\"]\n          - [\"No features (A3)\", \"0D\", \"30.5%\", \"-0.8\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: CGS vs DiU per-DOF uncertainty correlation scatter。若协方差退化，CGS per-DOF std ≈ marginal std ≈ DiU 的近似值，两者高度相关。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Epistemic vs aleatoric 区分在 worst 档下无实质意义。所有 uncertainty features 的贡献都被\n      K=10 协方差退化所限制。对 reframed paper：可以分析在什么 K 值下 epistemic (multi-sample)\n      features 才开始优于 aleatoric (single-pass) features，为 future work 指明方向。\n\n  - name: \"Feature Importance Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: >\n      CRM gradient magnitude w.r.t. 45 uncertainty features, broken down by perturbation type.\n      Validates dimension-selective correction mechanism.\n    expected_results:\n      avg_gradient_conformal_features: 0.003\n      avg_gradient_observation_features: 0.041\n      gradient_ratio_obs_over_conf: 13.7\n      top5_features_all_observation: true\n      conformal_feature_gradient_std: 0.001\n      perturbation_specific_pattern: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      CRM 对 conformal features 的梯度幅值仅为 observation features 的 1/14，且 conformal\n      features 之间的梯度差异极小（std=0.001），说明 CRM 没有学到 dimension-selective 的利用模式。\n      所有 top-5 重要特征均来自 observation embedding，而非 conformal 特征。这直接反映了\n      conformal 特征在 K=10 退化下的信息匮乏：CRM 的梯度下降过程中自然地学会降低对低信息量\n      输入的依赖权重。没有 perturbation-specific 的特征利用模式（所有偏移类型下的梯度分布\n      几乎相同），否定了 \"dimension-selective correction\" 的机制假设——CRM 没有在不同偏移下\n      选择性地依赖不同 DOF 的 conformal 信息。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 15: Feature Importance (Gradient Magnitude)\"\n        columns: [\"Feature Group\", \"Mean |∇|\", \"Std |∇|\", \"Top-5 Count\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Observation embedding (128D)\", \"0.041\", \"0.018\", \"5/5\"]\n          - [\"Per-DOF std (7D)\", \"0.004\", \"0.001\", \"0/5\"]\n          - [\"Per-DOF conformal radius (7D)\", \"0.003\", \"0.001\", \"0/5\"]\n          - [\"Ellipsoid features (3D)\", \"0.002\", \"0.001\", \"0/5\"]\n          - [\"Cross-DOF covariance (28D)\", \"0.002\", \"0.001\", \"0/5\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Gradient magnitude heatmap — 45 conformal features × 7 perturbation types。整体呈均匀低值，无 perturbation-specific pattern。\"\n      - \"Fig: Feature importance bar chart — observation 远超 conformal，所有 conformal 子组几乎持平。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Feature importance 分析提供了 mechanism-level 的证据：CRM 未学到 dimension-selective\n      correction。这从网络内部行为角度解释了为什么 A3、A4 的 ablation gap 如此小——conformal\n      features 在 forward pass 中就被实质性忽略了。对 reframed paper，这是一个关键的 analysis\n      贡献：精确地展示了 what happens inside the correction network when conformal features\n      are uninformative。\n\n  - name: \"SnapFlow Integration\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: >\n      K=10 × 1-step distilled generation. Test sample diversity preservation and inference speedup.\n    expected_results:\n      snapflow_inference_time_ms: 18\n      original_inference_time_ms: 142\n      speedup_factor: 7.9\n      snapflow_sample_diversity_std_mean: 0.008\n      original_sample_diversity_std_mean: 0.023\n      diversity_preservation_ratio: 0.35\n      snapflow_libero_plus_acr: 0.292\n      original_libero_plus_acr: 0.313\n      snapflow_performance_drop: 2.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      SnapFlow 1-step distillation 实现 7.9x 推理加速，但样本多样性仅保留 35%（std 从 0.023 降到\n      0.008）。多样性大幅下降直接恶化了 CGS 的统计估计质量：K=10 样本本身就不多，distillation\n      进一步压缩了样本空间覆盖，导致协方差估计更加退化。在 worst 档下这个影响被放大——原始 K=10\n      已经不够用，SnapFlow 的 diversity collapse 使情况更差。性能下降 2.1% 在可接受范围但不理想。\n      对 reframed paper 的意义有限，仅作为 efficiency-accuracy trade-off 的一个数据点。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 16: SnapFlow Integration\"\n        columns: [\"Config\", \"Inference (ms)\", \"Sample Div.\", \"Plus-Avg\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Original (50-step)\", \"142\", \"0.023\", \"31.3%\"]\n          - [\"SnapFlow (1-step)\", \"18\", \"0.008\", \"29.2%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: SnapFlow vs original sample distribution — t-SNE of K=10 samples showing diversity collapse under distillation。\"\n    analysis: >\n      SnapFlow 加速显著但样本多样性损失严重。在 worst 档下，原始 K=10 协方差已退化，SnapFlow\n      进一步加剧问题。这提供了一个 practical insight：inference-time correction 依赖多样化样本\n      的方法不应与 aggressive distillation 组合使用。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11285,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11285},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7d120e96-99ee-4673-a8af-ddbc24807528","uuid":"81920cc0-46ca-4a12-9bb2-9d52e8c8a685"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":242279,"duration_api_ms":244444,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 不可维持。需要重构 story 从 method paper 转为 analysis/empirical-study paper。\n  核心转向: \"When does multivariate conformal prediction help robot action correction? A systematic empirical study.\"\n  贡献变为: (1) 负面结果的价值——证明 synthetic MVP 中的 per-DOF advantage 不能 naively transfer\n  到 high-dimensional VLA action spaces，分析为什么 (covariance degeneracy, K=10 insufficient,\n  flow-matching sample geometry); (2) 对比分析 CGS vs scalar CP vs DiU 在不同分布偏移类型下的行为差异，\n  提供 practitioner guidance; (3) COC 信号失败模式的系统分析——什么条件下自参考校准信号可靠/不可靠。\n  放弃 CoRL 投稿，瞄 ICLR 2027 workshop 或 reframe 后投 ICLR 2027 main。若 CRM 本身（不依赖\n  conformal features）仍有 >5% 增益，可考虑退到 \"observation-conditioned residual correction\" 的\n  simpler story，但这与 A2C2 区分度低。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"ACR-VLA Full Pipeline on SmolVLA\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: >\n      ACR-VLA full pipeline on SmolVLA base: CGS + ACI/COC + CRM. Train CRM on LIBERO demos\n      + synthetic augmentation. Evaluate on LIBERO (nominal preservation) + LIBERO-Plus L3-L5.\n    expected_results:\n      libero_nominal_success_rate_base: 0.95\n      libero_nominal_success_rate_acr: 0.91\n      libero_nominal_drop_pct: 4.2\n      libero_plus_L3_success_base: 0.42\n      libero_plus_L3_success_acr: 0.45\n      libero_plus_L4_success_base: 0.28\n      libero_plus_L4_success_acr: 0.31\n      libero_plus_L5_success_base: 0.15\n      libero_plus_L5_success_acr: 0.18\n      libero_plus_avg_success_gain_abs: 3.3\n      crm_train_loss_final: 0.0082\n      cgs_avg_coverage_empirical: 0.87\n      cgs_ledoit_wolf_shrinkage_intensity: 0.91\n      inference_latency_overhead_ms: 14.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 worst 档下，ACR-VLA 全流程仅带来 ~3% 的 LIBERO-Plus 绝对增益。根本原因在于 flow-matching\n      VLA 的 K=10 样本在 7D action space 中的协方差结构严重退化：Ledoit-Wolf shrinkage intensity\n      达 0.91（接近 1.0 = 对角阵），意味着估计的协方差几乎完全被 shrink 到对角形式，CGS 提取的\n      per-DOF conformal 特征实质上退化为独立的 per-dimension marginal 信息，丧失了 multivariate CP\n      的核心优势——跨维度协方差编码。CRM 仍然学到了一些有用的观测条件残差（来自 observation embedding），\n      但 conformal 特征的贡献微乎其微。名义性能下降 4.2% 超过理想范围，因为 CRM 在 in-distribution\n      数据上的残差校正引入了不必要的扰动——分布内样本本身质量较高，校正反而降低了精度。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 1: LIBERO / LIBERO-Plus Success Rates\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"LIBERO (nominal)\", \"L3\", \"L4\", \"L5\", \"Plus-Avg\", \"Δ vs Base\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"SmolVLA (base)\", \"95.0%\", \"42.0%\", \"28.0%\", \"15.0%\", \"28.3%\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"ACR-VLA (ours)\", \"91.0%\", \"45.0%\", \"31.0%\", \"18.0%\", \"31.3%\", \"+3.0\"]\n          - [\"SRPO (reported)\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", \"—\", \"82.1%\", \"—\"]\n      - name: \"Table 2: CGS Covariance Diagnostics\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"MVP (3D)\", \"VLA (7D)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Ledoit-Wolf shrinkage intensity\", \"0.42\", \"0.91\"]\n          - [\"Effective rank of Σ̂\", \"2.7\", \"1.3\"]\n          - [\"Off-diagonal magnitude (mean |r_ij|)\", \"0.38\", \"0.06\"]\n          - [\"Condition number (shrunk Σ̂)\", \"4.2\", \"1.8\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Covariance heatmap comparison — MVP 3D (clear off-diagonal structure) vs VLA 7D (near-diagonal after shrinkage). 直观展示 K=10 + high-dim 导致协方差信息丧失。\"\n      - \"Fig: Per-task success rate scatter — base vs ACR-VLA on LIBERO-Plus 10 tasks. 多数任务增益 <5%, 个别任务出现负增益。\"\n    analysis: >\n      全流程结果确认了 worst 档核心假设：K=10 样本在 7D 空间下的 Ledoit-Wolf 估计产生近对角协方差，\n      CGS 的 multivariate CP 优势不存在。3.3% 的增益主要来自 CRM 的 observation-conditioned 残差\n      能力，而非 conformal 特征。名义性能 4.2% 下降是一个严重信号，表明 CRM 在 in-distribution 上\n      过度校正。这为后续 A3 ablation 设定了基线——如果 A3 gap 很小，则确认 conformal 特征无贡献。\n\n  - name: \"A3 Ablation — CRM without Conformal Features\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: >\n      CRM without conformal features (observation-conditioned residual only, equivalent to\n      A2C2-style generic residual). MAKE-OR-BREAK for Claim 1.\n    expected_results:\n      libero_plus_avg_success_acr_full: 0.313\n      libero_plus_avg_success_a3_no_conformal: 0.305\n      a3_ablation_gap_abs: 0.8\n      a3_ablation_gap_pct_relative: 2.6\n      libero_nominal_a3: 0.92\n      a3_vs_full_pvalue_paired_ttest: 0.38\n    result_rationale: >\n      A3 kill criterion 触发。去掉 45D conformal 特征后，CRM 仅依赖 observation embedding 做残差\n      校正，性能仅下降 0.8 个百分点（统计不显著，p=0.38）。这直接证明在真实 VLA 设置下，conformal\n      特征几乎不携带 CRM 无法从 observation 中获取的额外信息。原因有二：(1) 如 plan_001 分析，\n      K=10 + Ledoit-Wolf 产生的协方差过度 shrink，per-DOF 特征退化为近似 isotropic 的无差别信号；\n      (2) CRM 的 observation encoder 已经隐式捕获了\"当前观测与训练分布的偏差\"信息，这与 CGS 试图\n      编码的 epistemic uncertainty 高度冗余。在 MVP 3D 环境下 per-DOF 特征有效是因为：3D 空间\n      K=10 给出 p/n=0.3 的合理比率，协方差结构保留完好；而 7D 空间 p/n=0.7 时结构信息被 shrinkage\n      抹杀。这是一个 dimensionality-driven 的 transfer failure。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 3: A3 Ablation — Conformal Features Kill Test\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"LIBERO (nom.)\", \"Plus-Avg\", \"Δ vs Full\", \"p-value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"ACR-VLA (full, 45D conf.)\", \"91.0%\", \"31.3%\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"A3: no conformal (obs only)\", \"92.0%\", \"30.5%\", \"-0.8\", \"0.38\"]\n          - [\"SmolVLA (base, no CRM)\", \"95.0%\", \"28.3%\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n      - name: \"Table 4: A3 Detailed Per-Level Breakdown\"\n        columns: [\"Level\", \"Full ACR-VLA\", \"A3 (no conf.)\", \"Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"L3\", \"45.0%\", \"44.5%\", \"-0.5\"]\n          - [\"L4\", \"31.0%\", \"30.0%\", \"-1.0\"]\n          - [\"L5\", \"18.0%\", \"17.0%\", \"-1.0\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Bar chart with error bars — Full ACR-VLA vs A3 vs Base on LIBERO-Plus. Error bars (95% CI) 大幅重叠，gap 不显著。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Kill criterion 触发：A3 gap = 0.8% < 2% 阈值，且统计不显著。Claim 1 (\"per-DOF conformal features\n      enable dimension-selective correction\") 在真实 VLA 上不成立。CRM 的全部增益来自 observation-conditioned\n      残差，与 A2C2 类方法功能等价。这是论文核心贡献的致命打击——方法的独特卖点（将 multivariate CP 统计量\n      作为校正网络输入特征）被证伪。值得保留的发现是 CRM 残差本身仍有 ~2-3% 的增益（A3 vs base），但这\n      不构成新颖贡献。\n\n  - name: \"A4 Ablation — Scalar vs Per-DOF Uncertainty Features\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: >\n      CRM with scalar uncertainty (Euclidean distance like ReconVLA) replacing 45D per-DOF\n      features. Validates per-DOF > scalar.\n    expected_results:\n      libero_plus_avg_success_a4_scalar: 0.310\n      libero_plus_avg_success_full_perDOF: 0.313\n      a4_ablation_gap_abs: 0.3\n      a4_pvalue: 0.62\n      libero_nominal_a4: 0.915\n    result_rationale: >\n      Per-DOF vs scalar gap 仅 0.3 个百分点，完全在噪声范围内（p=0.62），落入 worst 档的 [-1, 1] 区间。\n      这与 A3 结果高度一致：如果 conformal 特征整体贡献几乎为零（A3 gap ~0.8%），那么 conformal\n      特征的 granularity（per-DOF vs scalar）自然也不会有区别。两种特征形式都只是噪声输入，CRM 学会\n      忽略它们而依赖 observation embedding。这进一步确认了 worst 档假设——在 K=10 flow-matching\n      样本的退化协方差下，无论用 45D 还是 1D 编码 uncertainty，信息量都接近零。MVP 中 per-DOF 的\n      显著优势（group6: 0.024512 vs 0.029498, ~17% 相对改善）完全无法复现，因为 MVP 的 3D 空间\n      协方差结构是真实可估计的，而 7D VLA 空间中协方差信息被 shrinkage 摧毁。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: A4 Ablation — Per-DOF vs Scalar\"\n        columns: [\"Feature Type\", \"Dim\", \"Plus-Avg\", \"Δ vs Full\", \"p-value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Per-DOF (full ACR-VLA)\", \"45D\", \"31.3%\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Scalar (Euclidean)\", \"1D\", \"31.0%\", \"-0.3\", \"0.62\"]\n          - [\"No conformal (A3)\", \"0D\", \"30.5%\", \"-0.8\", \"0.38\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 三种 feature granularity (45D, 1D, 0D) 的 LIBERO-Plus 成功率。三者几乎持平，error bars 完全重叠。对比 MVP 结果中 per-DOF 的显著优势，展示 transfer gap。\"\n    analysis: >\n      A4 结果与 A3 形成完整的否定证据链：不仅 conformal 特征整体贡献微弱（A3），per-DOF 的额外\n      granularity 也不提供任何增量（A4）。这否定了 Claim 1 的全部两层逻辑。对 empirical study\n      reframe 而言，这是一个有价值的负面结果——可以精确量化 MVP-to-VLA transfer gap 并分析 root cause。\n\n  - name: \"SRPO Stacking\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: >\n      ACR-VLA stacked on SRPO-finetuned VLA. Train new CRM on SRPO checkpoint + LIBERO demos.\n      Evaluate on LIBERO-Plus.\n    expected_results:\n      srpo_baseline_libero_plus: 0.821\n      srpo_plus_acr_libero_plus: 0.832\n      srpo_stacking_gain_abs: 1.1\n      srpo_stacking_pvalue: 0.29\n      srpo_nominal_drop: 1.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      SRPO stacking gain 仅 1.1%（82.1% → 83.2%），落入 worst 档 [0, 2] 区间且统计不显著。\n      根本原因：SRPO 通过 RL finetuning 已经在训练时对 LIBERO-Plus 的分布偏移做了适应，留给\n      inference-time correction 的残差空间极小。SRPO 已将 base VLA 从 ~28% 提升到 82.1%，\n      吃掉了绝大部分可恢复的性能差距。CRM 能校正的残余错误主要是 SRPO 也无法解决的 fundamental\n      failures（如完全未见过的 layout 组合），这些 failure modes 不是简单的 action bias 可以\n      通过残差校正解决的。此外，SRPO 的 policy 已经过 RL 优化，action distribution 更加 peaked，\n      K=10 flow-matching 样本的多样性更低，进一步削弱了 CGS 的统计估计质量。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 6: SRPO Stacking Results\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Plus-Avg\", \"Δ vs SRPO\", \"p-value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"SRPO (baseline)\", \"82.1%\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"SRPO + ACR-VLA\", \"83.2%\", \"+1.1\", \"0.29\"]\n          - [\"SmolVLA + ACR-VLA\", \"31.3%\", \"+3.0 vs base\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Stacking gain diminishing returns — X轴: base policy 性能，Y轴: ACR-VLA 增量。展示 base 越强增量越小的趋势。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Claim 3 降级为 \"complementary in principle\"。1.1% 增益不构成 convincing evidence of orthogonal\n      value。对 reframed paper，这支持一个 insight：inference-time correction 的 ceiling 受限于\n      training-time optimization 已覆盖的 error modes。当 base policy 很强时，剩余 failures 是\n      结构性的，不可通过 action residual 修复。\n\n  - name: \"COC Signal Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: >\n      COC signal validation: (a) Spearman ρ between episode COC coverage fraction and task\n      success, (b) ACI convergence plot, (c) ellipsoid volume comparison vs static calibration.\n    expected_results:\n      coc_success_spearman_rho: 0.18\n      coc_success_spearman_pvalue: 0.04\n      aci_converged_episodes_pct: 0.72\n      aci_convergence_steps_median: 85\n      aci_final_coverage_mean: 0.89\n      aci_target_coverage: 0.90\n      ellipsoid_volume_aci_vs_static_narrowing_pct: 6.5\n      ellipsoid_volume_aci_mean_log: 2.31\n      ellipsoid_volume_static_mean_log: 2.47\n    result_rationale: >\n      COC-success Spearman ρ = 0.18，虽统计显著（p=0.04，因为 N 足够大）但实质相关性极弱，远低于\n      可用阈值。核心问题：COC 是一个 chunk-overlap 一致性度量，衡量相邻 action chunks 的预测\n      一致性。在高分布偏移下（L4-L5），VLA 的预测本身已经高度不稳定，COC 信号的 noise floor 很高。\n      更根本的是，COC 衡量的是\"预测一致性\"而非\"预测正确性\"——一个 consistently wrong 的 policy\n      会产生高 COC 但低 success。ACI 虽然 converge 到接近目标覆盖率（0.89 vs 0.90 target），\n      但 ellipsoid volume 仅收窄 6.5%（低于 10% 阈值），说明 ACI 的在线适应相比 static calibration\n      几乎没有 tighten confidence region 的效果。原因是 COC 信号太嘈杂，ACI 的 step-size 需要\n      设得很小才能 converge，导致适应速度极慢，ellipsoid 几乎不变。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 7: COC Signal Quality\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Value\", \"Threshold\", \"Pass?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Spearman ρ (COC vs success)\", \"0.18\", \">0.3\", \"FAIL\"]\n          - [\"p-value\", \"0.04\", \"<0.05\", \"PASS (but weak ρ)\"]\n          - [\"Ellipsoid narrowing vs static\", \"6.5%\", \">10%\", \"FAIL\"]\n          - [\"ACI coverage (target=0.90)\", \"0.89\", \"±0.02\", \"PASS\"]\n      - name: \"Table 8: ACI Convergence by Perturbation Level\"\n        columns: [\"Level\", \"Converged %\", \"Median Steps\", \"Final Coverage\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"L3\", \"82%\", \"62\", \"0.90\"]\n          - [\"L4\", \"70%\", \"91\", \"0.88\"]\n          - [\"L5\", \"58%\", \"118\", \"0.87\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Scatter plot — COC episode fraction (X) vs task success (Y, binary). 点云分散，弱正相关趋势几乎不可辨。\"\n      - \"Fig: ACI alpha trajectory across episodes，分 L3/L4/L5。L3 平稳收敛，L5 oscillate 严重。\"\n      - \"Fig: Ellipsoid volume CDF — ACI vs static。两条曲线几乎重合，narrowing 微弱。\"\n    analysis: >\n      COC 作为自参考校准信号在真实 VLA 上不可靠。Claim 2 的 kill criterion 部分触发（ρ < 0.3 AND\n      narrowing < 10% 均满足）。ACI 虽然能 converge coverage，但这只是因为 conformal prediction\n      的理论保证——它并不意味着 ACI 提供了比 static 更有用的 uncertainty 估计。对 reframed paper，\n      COC 失败模式分析本身是有价值的贡献：可以系统地刻画什么条件下 self-referential calibration 信号\n      可靠（低偏移、policy 足够 smooth）vs 不可靠（高偏移、prediction instability）。\n\n  - name: \"A1 Ablation — CRM without ACI\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: >\n      CRM without ACI (static CGS calibration, no online adaptation). Isolates ACI contribution.\n    expected_results:\n      libero_plus_avg_a1_static: 0.308\n      libero_plus_avg_full_aci: 0.313\n      a1_gap_abs: 0.5\n      a1_pvalue: 0.51\n      libero_nominal_a1: 0.915\n    result_rationale: >\n      ACI 贡献仅 0.5 个百分点，不显著。与 plan_005 的 COC 信号分析一致：如果 COC 信号本身就不\n      可靠（ρ=0.18），那么基于 COC 的 ACI 在线更新自然不能比 static calibration 做得更好。\n      ACI 的 alpha 调整幅度太小（因为 step size 保守以应对 noisy COC），实质上 conformal threshold\n      几乎没有偏离初始 static 值。此外，由于 A3 已表明 conformal 特征整体贡献微弱，ACI 对 conformal\n      threshold 的精细调整更是无关紧要——即便 threshold 是完美的，产生的 per-DOF 特征也不被 CRM 有效利用。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 9: A1 Ablation — ACI Contribution\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Plus-Avg\", \"Δ vs Full\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Full ACR-VLA (ACI)\", \"31.3%\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"A1: Static CGS (no ACI)\", \"30.8%\", \"-0.5\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: ACI vs Static alpha 轨迹对比。Static 保持恒定，ACI 仅微小波动，两者产生的 conformal region 几乎相同。\"\n    analysis: >\n      ACI 组件在 worst 档下无实质贡献。结合 A3 的 conformal features 无贡献结论，ACI 优化的是\n      一个本身就无用的信号通道。\n\n  - name: \"A2 Ablation — ACI without CRM\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: >\n      ACI without CRM (CGS + COC + sample selection only, extending ReconVLA to multivariate).\n      Isolates CRM contribution.\n    expected_results:\n      libero_plus_avg_a2_no_crm: 0.295\n      libero_plus_avg_full: 0.313\n      a2_vs_base_gain: 1.2\n      a2_vs_full_gap: 1.8\n      libero_nominal_a2: 0.94\n    result_rationale: >\n      无 CRM 时，ACR-VLA 退化为基于 multivariate CP 的 sample selection 方法（类似 ReconVLA 但用\n      Mahalanobis distance 替代 Euclidean distance）。增益仅 1.2%（vs base 28.3% → 29.5%）。\n      原因：(1) 样本选择只能从 K=10 个已有样本中选最好的，不能合成新动作——ceiling 很低；\n      (2) 在 K=10 退化协方差下，Mahalanobis distance 和 Euclidean distance 高度相关（因为协方差\n      近对角），multivariate extension 不比 ReconVLA 的标量方案好多少。CRM 的存在至少提供了\n      observation-conditioned 残差校正能力（A2 vs full gap = 1.8%），这是该 pipeline 中唯一\n      有实质贡献的组件，但这个贡献不依赖 conformal features（如 A3 所示）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 10: A2 Ablation — CRM Contribution\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Plus-Avg\", \"Nominal\", \"Δ vs Base\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base SmolVLA\", \"28.3%\", \"95.0%\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"A2: CGS+ACI only (no CRM)\", \"29.5%\", \"94.0%\", \"+1.2\"]\n          - [\"Full ACR-VLA\", \"31.3%\", \"91.0%\", \"+3.0\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 组件分解 bar chart — Base → +CGS/ACI selection → +CRM。Selection 贡献 ~1.2%, CRM 贡献 ~1.8%。\"\n    analysis: >\n      A2 确认 CRM（残差校正）是 pipeline 中唯一有意义的组件。但 A3 已证明 CRM 的效果不依赖\n      conformal features。组合 A2+A3 的结论：ACR-VLA = observation-conditioned residual + marginal\n      sample selection benefit，与原始 framing 的 \"structured uncertainty-driven correction\" 无关。\n\n  - name: \"Per-Perturbation Breakdown\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      ACR-VLA gain across 7 LIBERO-Plus perturbation dimensions (camera, noise, robot-state,\n      light, background, layout, language).\n    expected_results:\n      gain_camera: 5.2\n      gain_noise: 4.8\n      gain_robot_state: 3.1\n      gain_light: 2.5\n      gain_background: 1.8\n      gain_layout: -0.5\n      gain_language: -1.2\n      perturbation_dims_with_significant_gain: 2\n      perturbation_dims_with_negative: 2\n    result_rationale: >\n      仅 2 个维度（camera, noise）显示显著增益（>3%），与 worst 档 [0, 2] 维度范围吻合。\n      Camera 和 noise 是 synthetic augmentation 能较好覆盖的偏移类型——随机 crop/resize 和\n      Gaussian noise 是标准数据增强，CRM 在这两类偏移上有充足的训练数据。但即使在这两个维度上，\n      增益也主要来自 observation-conditioned residual（与 A3 一致），而非 conformal features。\n      Layout 和 language 出现负增益，因为这两类偏移无法通过 synthetic augmentation 覆盖，\n      CRM 面临 out-of-distribution 输入且过度校正。Layout 改变了物体空间关系，CRM 学到的\n      残差模式不适用；language 改变了任务语义，CRM 的 observation encoder 无法正确解读意图。\n      这两个维度的 negative transfer 是 worst 档的典型特征——CRM 在未见过的偏移类型上有害。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 11: Per-Perturbation Success Rate Breakdown\"\n        columns: [\"Perturbation\", \"Base\", \"ACR-VLA\", \"Δ\", \"Significant?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Camera\", \"38.0%\", \"43.2%\", \"+5.2\", \"Yes (p<0.05)\"]\n          - [\"Noise\", \"35.0%\", \"39.8%\", \"+4.8\", \"Yes (p<0.05)\"]\n          - [\"Robot-state\", \"30.0%\", \"33.1%\", \"+3.1\", \"Marginal (p=0.08)\"]\n          - [\"Light\", \"42.0%\", \"44.5%\", \"+2.5\", \"No (p=0.15)\"]\n          - [\"Background\", \"40.0%\", \"41.8%\", \"+1.8\", \"No (p=0.22)\"]\n          - [\"Layout\", \"22.0%\", \"21.5%\", \"-0.5\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"Language\", \"18.0%\", \"16.8%\", \"-1.2\", \"No\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Radar/spider chart — 7 perturbation dimensions 的 ACR-VLA gain。右侧 camera/noise 突出，左侧 layout/language 凹陷。\"\n      - \"Fig: Heatmap — perturbation type × action DOF 的 CRM correction magnitude。展示 CRM 在不同偏移下的校正行为模式。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Per-perturbation 分析揭示了 synthetic augmentation 的根本局限：只有 augmentation 能覆盖的\n      偏移类型（camera, noise）才有增益，无法覆盖的类型（layout, language）反而有害。这对 reframed\n      paper 是一个有价值的 finding：practitioner guidance 应强调 inference-time correction 方法\n      需要与 training-time augmentation 的 coverage 匹配。\n\n  - name: \"A5 Ablation — CGS vs Bonferroni\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: >\n      CGS (joint Mahalanobis) vs per-DOF Bonferroni correction. Validates multivariate CP advantage.\n    expected_results:\n      libero_plus_avg_cgs_joint: 0.313\n      libero_plus_avg_bonferroni: 0.311\n      a5_gap_abs: 0.2\n      a5_pvalue: 0.74\n    result_rationale: >\n      CGS vs Bonferroni gap 仅 0.2%，完全在噪声范围内。由于 K=10 Ledoit-Wolf shrinkage 将协方差\n      矩阵推向近对角形式，joint Mahalanobis ellipsoid 和 per-DOF Bonferroni rectangle 在形状上\n      高度相似（均近似 axis-aligned）。multivariate CP 相对于 marginal Bonferroni 的理论优势\n      （更紧的 joint region、跨维度协方差利用）在协方差退化时不存在。这从另一个角度确认了 worst\n      档核心问题：K=10 在 7D 空间中不足以支撑有意义的 multivariate 统计。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 12: A5 — CGS vs Bonferroni\"\n        columns: [\"CP Method\", \"Plus-Avg\", \"Ellipsoid Vol (log)\", \"Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"CGS (joint Mahal.)\", \"31.3%\", \"2.31\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Bonferroni (per-DOF)\", \"31.1%\", \"2.45\", \"-0.2\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 2D slice (DOF 1 vs DOF 2) of CGS ellipse vs Bonferroni rectangle。两者几乎重合（ellipse nearly circular, rectangle nearly square）。\"\n    analysis: >\n      进一步确认 multivariate CP 在 K=10 + high-dim 下无优势。对 reframed paper 的贡献：\n      提供了 p/n ratio threshold 的 empirical evidence——multivariate CP 何时 degrade 到\n      与 marginal 等价。\n\n  - name: \"A6 Ablation — COC vs Episode-Level Success for ACI\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      COC signal vs episode-level task success for ACI update. Validates self-referential\n      per-step signal.\n    expected_results:\n      libero_plus_avg_a6_episode_signal: 0.318\n      libero_plus_avg_coc_signal: 0.313\n      a6_gap_abs: -0.5\n      ellipsoid_narrowing_episode_pct: 12.8\n      ellipsoid_narrowing_coc_pct: 6.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      Episode-level success signal 实际上比 COC 自参考信号表现更好（+0.5%），且 ellipsoid\n      narrowing 更大（12.8% vs 6.5%）。这直接否定了 Claim 2 的核心 value proposition——\n      自参考 COC 信号应该比需要外部监督的 episode signal 更有价值，但事实相反。原因是 episode\n      success 是 ground truth supervision，虽然粒度更粗（per-episode vs per-step）且需要\n      等到 episode 结束，但信号质量远高于 COC 的嘈杂 proxy。COC 作为 per-step 信号的优势\n      （更快适应、不需要外部 reward）在实践中被其 noise 抵消。这对 reframed paper 是一个重要\n      negative result：self-referential calibration 在信号质量上无法替代 external supervision。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 13: A6 — ACI Signal Source Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Signal\", \"Plus-Avg\", \"Ellipsoid Narrowing\", \"Requires External?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"COC (self-referential)\", \"31.3%\", \"6.5%\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"Episode success\", \"31.8%\", \"12.8%\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"Static (no adaptation)\", \"30.8%\", \"0%\", \"No\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: ACI alpha 轨迹对比——COC signal (高 variance oscillation) vs episode signal (smooth convergence)。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Self-referential COC 信号劣于 episode-level external signal，否定 Claim 2 的 practical value。\n      对 empirical study reframe 有价值：量化了 self-referential vs supervised calibration 的 gap，\n      提供 guidance on when self-referential is acceptable（低偏移、高 SNR 场景）vs not（高偏移）。\n\n  - name: \"A7 Ablation — DiU Aleatoric vs CGS Epistemic Features\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      CRM with DiU aleatoric features replacing CGS epistemic features. Also test combined\n      epistemic+aleatoric 52D input.\n    expected_results:\n      libero_plus_avg_cgs_epistemic: 0.313\n      libero_plus_avg_diu_aleatoric: 0.316\n      libero_plus_avg_combined_52d: 0.314\n      a7_diu_vs_cgs_gap: 0.3\n      a7_combined_vs_cgs_gap: 0.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      DiU aleatoric features 略优于 CGS epistemic features（+0.3%），但差异不显著，三种配置几乎\n      持平。结合 A3 结论（conformal features 整体贡献 ~0.8%），epistemic vs aleatoric 的区分\n      在 0.8% 的总预算内进行比较本身就意义有限。DiU 略优的可能原因：DiU 的 single-pass aleatoric\n      uncertainty 不依赖 K=10 多次采样的协方差估计，避免了 K=10 退化问题，提供了稍微更稳定的\n      per-DOF uncertainty signal。但这个优势极其微弱，不足以支撑任何 claim。Combined 52D 没有\n      额外增益，说明两类特征高度冗余或都不被 CRM 有效利用。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 14: A7 — Epistemic vs Aleatoric Features\"\n        columns: [\"Feature Source\", \"Dim\", \"Plus-Avg\", \"Δ vs CGS\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"CGS epistemic\", \"45D\", \"31.3%\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"DiU aleatoric\", \"7D\", \"31.6%\", \"+0.3\"]\n          - [\"Combined\", \"52D\", \"31.4%\", \"+0.1\"]\n          - [\"No features (A3)\", \"0D\", \"30.5%\", \"-0.8\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: CGS vs DiU per-DOF uncertainty correlation scatter。若协方差退化，CGS per-DOF std ≈ marginal std ≈ DiU 的近似值，两者高度相关。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Epistemic vs aleatoric 区分在 worst 档下无实质意义。所有 uncertainty features 的贡献都被\n      K=10 协方差退化所限制。对 reframed paper：可以分析在什么 K 值下 epistemic (multi-sample)\n      features 才开始优于 aleatoric (single-pass) features，为 future work 指明方向。\n\n  - name: \"Feature Importance Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: >\n      CRM gradient magnitude w.r.t. 45 uncertainty features, broken down by perturbation type.\n      Validates dimension-selective correction mechanism.\n    expected_results:\n      avg_gradient_conformal_features: 0.003\n      avg_gradient_observation_features: 0.041\n      gradient_ratio_obs_over_conf: 13.7\n      top5_features_all_observation: true\n      conformal_feature_gradient_std: 0.001\n      perturbation_specific_pattern: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      CRM 对 conformal features 的梯度幅值仅为 observation features 的 1/14，且 conformal\n      features 之间的梯度差异极小（std=0.001），说明 CRM 没有学到 dimension-selective 的利用模式。\n      所有 top-5 重要特征均来自 observation embedding，而非 conformal 特征。这直接反映了\n      conformal 特征在 K=10 退化下的信息匮乏：CRM 的梯度下降过程中自然地学会降低对低信息量\n      输入的依赖权重。没有 perturbation-specific 的特征利用模式（所有偏移类型下的梯度分布\n      几乎相同），否定了 \"dimension-selective correction\" 的机制假设——CRM 没有在不同偏移下\n      选择性地依赖不同 DOF 的 conformal 信息。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 15: Feature Importance (Gradient Magnitude)\"\n        columns: [\"Feature Group\", \"Mean |∇|\", \"Std |∇|\", \"Top-5 Count\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Observation embedding (128D)\", \"0.041\", \"0.018\", \"5/5\"]\n          - [\"Per-DOF std (7D)\", \"0.004\", \"0.001\", \"0/5\"]\n          - [\"Per-DOF conformal radius (7D)\", \"0.003\", \"0.001\", \"0/5\"]\n          - [\"Ellipsoid features (3D)\", \"0.002\", \"0.001\", \"0/5\"]\n          - [\"Cross-DOF covariance (28D)\", \"0.002\", \"0.001\", \"0/5\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Gradient magnitude heatmap — 45 conformal features × 7 perturbation types。整体呈均匀低值，无 perturbation-specific pattern。\"\n      - \"Fig: Feature importance bar chart — observation 远超 conformal，所有 conformal 子组几乎持平。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Feature importance 分析提供了 mechanism-level 的证据：CRM 未学到 dimension-selective\n      correction。这从网络内部行为角度解释了为什么 A3、A4 的 ablation gap 如此小——conformal\n      features 在 forward pass 中就被实质性忽略了。对 reframed paper，这是一个关键的 analysis\n      贡献：精确地展示了 what happens inside the correction network when conformal features\n      are uninformative。\n\n  - name: \"SnapFlow Integration\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: >\n      K=10 × 1-step distilled generation. Test sample diversity preservation and inference speedup.\n    expected_results:\n      snapflow_inference_time_ms: 18\n      original_inference_time_ms: 142\n      speedup_factor: 7.9\n      snapflow_sample_diversity_std_mean: 0.008\n      original_sample_diversity_std_mean: 0.023\n      diversity_preservation_ratio: 0.35\n      snapflow_libero_plus_acr: 0.292\n      original_libero_plus_acr: 0.313\n      snapflow_performance_drop: 2.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      SnapFlow 1-step distillation 实现 7.9x 推理加速，但样本多样性仅保留 35%（std 从 0.023 降到\n      0.008）。多样性大幅下降直接恶化了 CGS 的统计估计质量：K=10 样本本身就不多，distillation\n      进一步压缩了样本空间覆盖，导致协方差估计更加退化。在 worst 档下这个影响被放大——原始 K=10\n      已经不够用，SnapFlow 的 diversity collapse 使情况更差。性能下降 2.1% 在可接受范围但不理想。\n      对 reframed paper 的意义有限，仅作为 efficiency-accuracy trade-off 的一个数据点。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 16: SnapFlow Integration\"\n        columns: [\"Config\", \"Inference (ms)\", \"Sample Div.\", \"Plus-Avg\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Original (50-step)\", \"142\", \"0.023\", \"31.3%\"]\n          - [\"SnapFlow (1-step)\", \"18\", \"0.008\", \"29.2%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: SnapFlow vs original sample distribution — t-SNE of K=10 samples showing diversity collapse under distillation。\"\n    analysis: >\n      SnapFlow 加速显著但样本多样性损失严重。在 worst 档下，原始 K=10 协方差已退化，SnapFlow\n      进一步加剧问题。这提供了一个 practical insight：inference-time correction 依赖多样化样本\n      的方法不应与 aggressive distillation 组合使用。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"7d120e96-99ee-4673-a8af-ddbc24807528","total_cost_usd":0.38610474999999994,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11285,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":12131,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11285,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":12131,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11285,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11285},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":6243,"outputTokens":25,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.006368,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":12131,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":11285,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.37973674999999996,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"32eb3242-b731-438d-ac3a-90244ae792b3"}
